    <h1>Terms of Service for Merry Countdown</h1>
    <p>Effective Date: 2026-11-26</p>
    <p><a href="#cesky" lang="cs">Česká verze níže</a></p>

    <p>These terms apply to Merry Countdown (the "Application"), a Christmas countdown, advent calendar and wish list for
